                            	  2248: ; EXPORT side — carry-returning shims.
                            	  2249: ; Bit 8 of D0 = raw M68K carry. Extracted into CCR, then eori #$01,CCR
                            	  2250: ; reproduces the original function's carry normalization.
                            	  2251: ;==============================================================================
                            	  2252: 
                            	  2253: ; CopyNextRowToTransferBuf — no args. Returns D0.b=row, carry in bit 8.
