02:0003C766 0003C772        	  6775:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C76A 0003C7D6        	  6776:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
