                            	 13769: L1336F_Exit:
02:0003FA48 4E75            	 13770:     rts
                            	 13771: 
                            	 13772:     even
                            	 13773: TestDir:
                            	 13774:     ; If (test direction OR target direction) < 7, then allow this turn.
                            	 13775:     ; Else go try the next test direction.
                            	 13776:     ;
                            	 13777:     ; For 3/5 of the arrangements of angles between Link and
                            	 13778:     ; objects; this test yields a turn towards Link. The rest of
                            	 13779:     ; the time, the object will keep going in its original direction
                            	 13780:     ; or turn away from Link.
