                            	  4869: _L_z07_DrawSwordShotOrMagicShot_Flash:
02:0004BB16 101D            	  4870:     move.b  (A5)+,D0  ; PLA
                            	  4871:     ; Set the sprite attributes to (base attribute OR (frame counter AND 3)).
